      "start_line": 85,
      "text": "  rule dtdLoopBody\n    => If(Call(Name(\"isinstance\"),\n               (Name(\"number\"), Name(\"int\"), .Exprs)),\n         If(Compare(Name(\"number\"), CmpOp(\">\", Int(0))),\n           If(Compare(BinOp(\"%\", Name(\"number\"), Int(2)),\n                      CmpOp(\"==\", Int(1))),\n             AugAssign(Name(\"result\"), \"+\",\n                       BinOp(\"*\", Name(\"number\"), Name(\"number\"))),\n             .Stmts),\n           .Stmts),\n         .Stmts)"
    },
