      "start_line": 97,
      "text": "  rule dtdBody\n    => Assign(Name(\"result\"), Int(0))\n       Assign(Name(\"number\"), Int(0))\n       For(Name(\"number\"), Name(\"lst\"), dtdLoopBody)\n       Return(Name(\"result\"))"
